---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="360ENGAGE | Investor Brief" isDemo={true}>

    <!-- 1. The Hook (Hero) -->
    <section class="hero">
        <span class="tagline">360ENGAGE / Investor Due Diligence</span>
        <h1>The Frictionless<br>Fan Engagement Platform.</h1>
        <p>Institutional capital in sports tech is pivoting from analog reach to deterministic yield. 360ENGAGE uses
            advanced Conversational AI and app-less deployment to eliminate concourse friction—translating anonymous
            crowds into high-margin revenue.</p>
        <a href="360ENGAGE_Investor_Memo_Whitepaper.pdf" target="_blank" class="cta-button">Read the Investment
            Thesis</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Hard Metrics Bar based on deep research -->
    <div class="master-metrics">
        <div class="metrics-marquee">
            <div class="marquee-item">
                <span class="marquee-value">€665K</span>
                <span class="marquee-label">Annual Friction Penalty Loss</span>
            </div>
            <div class="marquee-item">
                <span class="marquee-value">11,000</span>
                <span class="marquee-label">Human Support Hrs Saved</span>
            </div>
            <div class="marquee-item">
                <span class="marquee-value">77%</span>
                <span class="marquee-label">Native App 3-Day Delete Rate</span>
            </div>
            <div class="marquee-item">
                <span class="marquee-value">2.5x</span>
                <span class="marquee-label">1st-Party LTV Multiplier</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Pillar 1: The Macro Reality -->
    <section id="investment-thesis" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <span class="tagline" style="justify-content: center;">Pillar 1: The Macro Reality</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading">The "Friction Penalty"</h2>
                <p class="impact-text">With media rights cooling to a 2.7% CAGR, revenue growth relies strictly on
                    per-capita in-stadium yield. Yet, analog infrastructure is destroying latent demand.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="data-grid">
                <div class="glass-card data-card">
                    <div class="stat-header">
                        <span class="stat-huge">40%</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="data-title">Queue Abandonment</h3>
                    <p class="data-desc">Over 40% of global sports fans wholly abandon merchandise and concession lines
                        due to excessive 15-minute half-time wait times.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card data-card">
                    <div class="stat-header">
                        <span class="stat-huge">€35K</span><span class="stat-sub">/ match</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="data-title">Uncaptured Intent</h3>
                    <p class="data-desc">Modeling for a standard 25,000-seat stadium indicates operators lose €35,000
                        per event in uncaptured intent—equating to <strong>€665,000 in pure EBITDA leakage</strong>
                        annually.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card data-card">
                    <div class="stat-header">
                        <span class="stat-sub">Up to</span><span class="stat-huge">+43%</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="data-title">F&B Spend Uplift</h3>
                    <p class="data-desc">Halving transaction wait-times via cashless and app-less infrastructure
                        organically lifts per-capita food & beverage spending by 43%.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Pillar 2: Architecture Moat vs. Native Collapse -->
    <section class="section" style="background: #0f172a;">
        <div class="container grid-2">
            <div>
                <span class="tagline" style="color: #60a5fa;">Pillar 2: Architecture Moat</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading" style="color: #ffffff;">The Native App is Dead.</h2>
                <p class="impact-text" style="color: #94a3b8;">Clubs spend millions developing siloed native apps. Yet
                    for the casual fan
                    visiting 1-2 times a year, the hurdle rate of downloading an app on congested stadium Wi-Fi results
                    in a structural failure.</p>

                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li style="color: #94a3b8;">
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap"
                            style="color: #60a5fa; border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3); background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1);">
                            📉</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: #e2e8f0;">77% 3-Day Deletion Rate:</strong> Independent analytics
                            confirm the vast majority of
                            local stadium apps are abandoned immediately post-match.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li style="color: #94a3b8;">
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap"
                            style="color: #60a5fa; border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3); background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1);">
                            🌐</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: #e2e8f0;">Browser-First Bypass:</strong> 360ENGAGE bypasses app stores
                            entirely using
                            Progressive Web Apps (PWA) triggered via seat-back QR codes, achieving up to <strong
                                style="color: #e2e8f0;">40%
                                active hub engagement</strong> instantly.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <!-- Stylized UI Mockup representation -->
                <div class="glass-card"
                    style="padding: 3rem; text-align: center; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4); background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);">
                    <div
                        style="width: 140px; height: 140px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; border: 2px dashed #475569; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);">
                        <svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.5"
                            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                            <rect x="7" y="7" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                            <rect x="14" y="7" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                            <rect x="7" y="14" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                            <rect x="14" y="14" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="data-title" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: #ffffff;">Frictionless. App-Less.</h3>
                    <p class="data-desc" style="color: #94a3b8;">Direct to the fan's browser. Zero download abandonment.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Solution Surface One: The Concierge AI -->
    <section class="section" style="background: rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.2); border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <div class="container grid-2">
            <div>
                <span class="tagline">Surface One</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading">The Concierge AI</h2>
                <p class="impact-text">A 24/7 conversational layer integrated directly into club websites, apps, and
                    phone lines. Designed for speed, convenience, and service excellence.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">🎙️</div>
                        <div><strong>Instant Resolution:</strong> AI agents answer recurring logistics, accessibility,
                            and ticketing questions with club-verified accuracy.</div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">💎</div>
                        <div><strong>Organic Upselling:</strong> Automatically identify supporter intent and seamlessly
                            present premium upgrade options during the flow of conversation.</div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
                    <a href="https://sports-ai-voice-assistant-live-demo.netlify.app/" target="_blank"
                        class="cta-button"
                        style="padding: 1rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);">
                        <span>▶</span> Try the Live Voice AI
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="glass-card"
                    style="padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);">
                    <div
                        style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2rem;">
                        🤖</div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #0f172a;">"Can I bring my kid's pram into
                        the East Stand?"</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Direct, accurate, club-verified responses—delivered in
                        seconds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. Solution Surface Two: The Game-Day Companion -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <div class="container grid-2">
            <div>
                <div class="glass-card"
                    style="padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);">
                    <div
                        style="width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; border: 2px dashed rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5); border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                        <span style="font-size: 5rem;">📱</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #0f172a;">Scan. Engage. Buy.</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Zero friction enablement. Triggered instantly by a seat or
                        concourse QR code.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="tagline">Surface Two</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading">The Game-Day Companion</h2>
                <p class="impact-text">An ultra-fast, browser-based QR experience right at the fan's seat. No app
                    downloading required—just instant, frictionless access.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">🛍️</div>
                        <div><strong>Merchandise on Demand:</strong> Let fans easily browse inventory and purchase
                            jerseys natively from the stands, bypassing busy concourses.</div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">🎟️</div>
                        <div><strong>Frictionless Renewals:</strong> Deliver one-tap upselling for future matches
                            directly to fans when in-stadium sentiment is high.</div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
                    <a href="https://360-engage-gameday-demo.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="cta-button"
                        style="padding: 1rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);">
                        <span>▶</span> Try the Game-Day App
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Pillar 3: AI Unit Economics -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <span class="tagline" style="justify-content: center;">Pillar 3: The Operational Engine</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading">Deflection to Conversion.</h2>
                <p class="impact-text">Our Concierge AI wedge protects overwhelmed ticket offices while acting as an
                    aggressive, conversational sales engine.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-2" style="gap: 2rem;">
                <!-- AI Defensive Card -->
                <div class="glass-card" style="padding: 3rem;">
                    <div
                        style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                        <h3 class="data-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 2rem;">Cost Deflection</h3>
                        <span
                            style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 600;">The
                            Defensive Wedge</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="feature-list" style="margin:0;">
                        <li>
                            <div class="feature-icon-wrap"
                                style="color: #10b981; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">🛡️</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>70% - 90% Containment:</strong> Advanced NLP handles all tier-1 logistical
                                support queries (parking, pram rules, access).
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div class="feature-icon-wrap"
                                style="color: #10b981; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">⏱️</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>11,000 Hours Saved:</strong> Verified benchmarks (e.g., Houston Astros) show
                                automated assistants save immense human operational load in a single season.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- AI Offensive Card -->
                <div class="glass-card" style="padding: 3rem; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);">
                    <div
                        style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                        <h3 class="data-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 2rem;">Sales Up-Cyling</h3>
                        <span
                            style="background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); color: #3b82f6; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 600;">The
                            Revenue Engine</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="feature-list" style="margin:0;">
                        <li>
                            <div class="feature-icon-wrap">🤝</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>+36% Deal Closure:</strong> Freeing staff from support allows human focus on
                                high-ticket hospitality, boosting close rates by 36%.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div class="feature-icon-wrap">💎</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>40% Upgrade Acceptance:</strong> In-game automated conversational seat-upgrades
                                trigger incredibly high emotional-purchase conversions.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Pillar 4: Valuation & The Endgame -->
    <section class="section" style="background: #0f172a;">
        <div class="container grid-2">
            <div>
                <div class="glass-card"
                    style="padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
                    <span
                        style="display: inline-block; font-size: 5rem; font-weight: 800; font-family: 'Outfit'; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">24%</span>
                    <h3 class="data-title" style="margin-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff;">The Identifiable Cap</h3>
                    <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;">The sports industry leaves
                        <strong>$130 Billion</strong> in unrealized value due to anonymous audiences. We are the bridge
                        to data sovereignty.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="tagline" style="color: #60a5fa;">Pillar 4: First-Party Sovereignty</span>
                <h2 class="impact-heading" style="color: #ffffff;">The Enterprise Valuation Multiplier.</h2>
                <p class="impact-text" style="color: #94a3b8;">Currently, clubs possess deterministic identification for
                    only <strong>24% of
                        their stadium audience</strong>. 76% remain anonymous seat fillers, forcing clubs to "rent"
                    access to their own fans via expensive social media algorithms.</p>
                <p class="impact-text" style="color: #94a3b8;">Because 360ENGAGE sits at the point of every transaction
                    and query, we capture
                    deterministic first-party identities. For top-tier organizations, solving this digital gap yields a
                    verified <strong>2.5x to 3.8x LTV multiplier</strong> per fan and unlocks massive premium CPMs for
                    algorithmic sponsor activations.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="footer-cta">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="tagline" style="justify-content: center;">Next Steps</span>
            <h2>Deploying the Definitive<br>Operating Layer.</h2>
            <p class="impact-text" style="margin: 0 auto 3rem auto; max-width: 600px;">We launch with the high-impact
                conversational wedge, instantly paying for itself, and deepen into the ultimate multi-tenant transaction
                platform.</p>
            <a href="360ENGAGE_Investor_Memo_Whitepaper.pdf" target="_blank" class="cta-button">Read Full Due Diligence
                & Financials</a>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>